title RecruitBook Batch 2 — Student Profile Foundation — Edit Flow

' ============================================================
' Vertical activity flow (no swimlanes) grouped by phase.
' One success path with concise fail-closed branches.
' ============================================================

start
:Student requests /student/dashboard\nor a profile section edit page;

' ----- Route guard (Next.js, server-side) -----
if (Valid Supabase session?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Redirect to /login;
  stop
endif
if (role = student AND account_status = active?) then (yes)
else (no)
  #FEE2E2:Redirect to /unauthorized;
  stop
endif
note right
  UI hiding is not authorization;
  client role/status is never trusted.
end note
:Render overview (derived completion);
:Open and submit ONE section form\n(basic / academic / activities /\nachievements / narrative);

' ----- Server action (independent re-check) -----
:Re-check authenticated user +\nrole/status server-side;
if (Student + active?) then (yes)
else (no)
  #FEE2E2:Redirect to /login or /unauthorized;
  stop
endif
:Treat submitted profile_id / row id\nas lookup key only;
note right
  The page guard is not enough. IDs from
  forms are lookup keys only — ownership
  is derived server-side, never trusted.
end note
if (Valid input?\nrequired fields, length caps, plain text) then (yes)
else (no)
  #FEE2E2:Show safe validation message;
  stop
endif
note right
  Narrative is plain text only.
  No markdown, no dangerouslySetInnerHTML.
end note
:Load or initialize owner profile safely\n(from current application_user_id);
if (Owner-scoped profile resolved?) then (yes)
else (no)
  #FEE2E2:Safe generic error;
  stop
endif
:Write via authenticated Supabase\nserver client (no service role);

' ----- Supabase PostgreSQL / RLS -----
if (Owner-only RLS passes?\nis_profile_owner(profile_id)) then (yes)
  :Save section data;
else (no — non-owner / db error)
  #FEE2E2:RLS denies — safe generic error;
  stop
endif
note right
  No service role — RLS remains
  authoritative. No counselor/admissions
  access in Batch 2; platform_admin is
  read-only OUTSIDE this edit path.
end note

' ----- Post-write -----
:Revalidate / reload profile overview;
:Recompute derived completion\nfrom field presence (not stored);
stop

